<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 104,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 104,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's actual receipts 104,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts $0.50 lower than mid-session Wednesday. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			     Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		47.50 -48.50	   48.50 -49.50</p>
<p>few			  47.00 -49.00	   48.00 -50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.    40.00 -41.50	   41.00 -42.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	     42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		47.00 -50.00	   47.00 -52.00</p>
